		SpearDash: Right click to perform a dash
		FlameThrowerAirblast: Right click to perform a compression blast at the cost of 7 gels
		DownedBarrier: The barrier of Terraria's true colours has shattered!
		DownedThreeGods: Gone is the balance between the Hallowed and the Evil...
		DownedSon: The border of reality collapses!
		GuideExtra1: The lizard tribe's pickaxe can expel the absolute darkness buried under the western sea. You may need to check there out.
		GuideExtra2: once told me that she was building the fourth machine in the dungeon, different from any that you've met.
		GuideExtra3: I heard that there's an entrance to an alternative world in the abyss, but I definitely don't recommend you to approach it.
		GuideExtra4: If you happen to grab any souls dropped from the Wyverns, you may attract a mysterious beast in high-altitude areas.
		GuideExtra5: I heard that a giant sea monster lurks beneath the ocean. Maybe you can lure it out with some unusual baits?
		GuideExtra6: The path of true ordeals has emerged. Grab that torch made out of lunar materials and eradicate the seal at the bottom of the abyss!
		GuideExtra7: After the barrier is brought to an end, you may encounter something novel in several biomes that remain neutral between hallow and evilness.
		GuideExtra8: I heard that the disciples of the Sun reside in the underworld and floating islands, cleaning up the remains of the cities.
		GuideExtra9: I heard that something would happen when you][c/fff143: prevent the sands from falling without letting it touch anything][c/ffff99:. But I have no idea how to do that.
		GuideExtra10: I heard that something would happen when][c/00ff7f: your maximum life has reached over 600][c/ffff99:. But I have no idea how to do that.
		GuideExtra11: I heard that something would happen when you][c/0000ff: let a block of water and a block of lava come into contact without turning into obsidians][c/ffff99:. But I have no idea how to do that.
		GuideExtra12: I hope you make a teleportation wrench out of those souls dropped from mechanic beasts. One day you'll need it to reach the world's seal.
		GuideExtra14: The potential of Corruption and Hallow has been released. You now have the opportunity to strengthen yourself for one last time.
		GuideExtra15: I recommend you slowly knock the newly born Shadow Orbs with a powerful hammer. You don't want to destroy them, or they'll metastasize to somewhere unexpected.
		GuideExtra16: The potential of Crimson and Hallow has been released. You now have the opportunity to strengthen yourself for one last time.
		GuideExtra17: I recommend you slowly knock the newly born Crimson Hearts with a powerful hammer. You don't want to destroy them, or they'll metastasize to somewhere unexpected.
		GuideExtra18: There have been traces of human activities around the dungeon these days. But before you go check that, there's more to do right now.
		GuideExtra19: I used to witness flashing lights high up in the sky. But before you go check that, there's more to do right now.
		GuideExtra20: I heard that something would happen when you][c/777777: place the hallowed altar on unseen blocks][c/ffff99:. But I have no idea how to do that.
		GuideExtra21: I heard that something would happen when you][c/303030: turn the dead creatures alive][c/ffff99:. But I have no idea how to do that.
		GuideExtra22: The Hallowed Altar holds one last usage, which can be unleashed with an ancient building... I tell you, the moment has finally come.
		GuideExtra23: Thanks for playing Homeward Journey! The mod is still unfinished. Stay tuned for more.
		DryadExtra1: Be careful when entering the Dungeon. I can feel that the power suppressing that place has fallen.
		DryadExtra2: ... I guess it's better this way.
		CyborgExtra1: Lost memories are returning to my disk drive for no reason. I don't remember having a backtracking mechanism at all!
		OnlyEffectiveOnFirstUse: Only effective on first use
