		SpellPage1: Chant:
		SpellPage2: Successful cast costs
		SpellPage3: mana
		SpellPage_Shadow: Fire five times at cursor's position with projectiles that deal 15% extra damage
		SpellPage_Blood: Fire five times at cursor's position with projectiles that inflict bleeding
		SpellPage_Growth:
			'''
			Place a circle that fires projectiles at a medium rate
			The circle lasts for a minute
			There can be only one circle
			'''
		SpellPage_Scatter:
			'''
			Fire five times at cursor's position, four shots each time
			Projectiles deal 33% damage
			'''
		SpellPage_Hive:
			'''
			Fire five times at cursor's position, five shots each time
			All projectiles home in on enemies
			Projectiles deal 20% damage and ignores 20 defense
			'''
		SpellPage_Skyfire: Fire three times at cursor's position with projectiles that explode upon dealing damage
		SpellPage_Freeze:
			'''
			Fire a projectile at cursor's position
			The projectile freeze enemy movement for 4 seconds
			This spell enters a 12 second cooldown hitting a normal enemy
			This spell enters a 50 second cooldown hitting a strong enemy
			'''
		SpellPage_Water:
			'''
			Fire four projectiles immediately
			Projectiles rotate around you at high speed
			'''
		SpellPage_Mana: Fire five times at cursor's position with projectiles that restore mana on hit
		SpellPage_Light: Rapidly fire ten times at cursor's position
		SpellPage_Night: Fire one time at cursor's position with a projectile that deals five times damage
		SpellPage_Sight:
			'''
			Summon a pair of phantoms that fights for you
			Phantoms fire projectiles that deal 16% damage
			Occupies 40 maximum mana
			'''
		SpellPage_Might:
			'''
			Summon a phantom probe that fights for you
			Phantoms fire projectiles that deal 12% damage and ignores 10 defense
			Each drone occupies 20 maximum mana
			'''
		SpellPage_Fright:
			'''
			Summon four phantom mechanical arms that fight for you
			Phantoms fire projectiles that deal 25% damage
			Occupies 60 maximum mana
			'''
		SpellPage_Thriving:
			'''
			Place a circle that fires projectiles at a fast rate
			The circle lasts for a minute
			There can be only one circle
			'''
		SpellPage_Eclipse:
			'''
			Creates an artificial astronomical phenomena
			Selected weapon no longer costs mana as long as the phenomena lasts
			The spell can not be used again until the phenomena ends
			'''
		SpellPage_Mirage:
			'''
			Gains a buff that lasts for 20 seconds
			This buff grants you the following effects:
			On hit, spawn a projectile of selected weapon
			that will fire from you to another enemy
			'''
		SpellPage_Blight:
			'''
			Summon a phantom television that fights for you
			Phantoms produce mana for you
			and fire projectiles that deal 25% damage
			Occupies 30 maximum mana
			'''
		SpellPage_Tornado:
			'''
			Summon a wave of projectiles that flushes the screen
			Homing projectiles deal 7% damage
			'''
		SpellPage_Rainbow:
			'''
			Gains a buff that lasts for 20 seconds
			This buff grants you the following effects:
			Projectiles of selected magic weapon recieve an extra update 
			Increase use speed of selected magic weapon by 7%
			'''
		SpellPage_Moon:
			'''
			Summon two phantom cultists that fight for you
			Phantoms attack with you with selected weapon
			Phantoms deals 45% damage
			Occupies 60 maximum mana
			'''
		SpellPage_Sun: Release a star that burst projectiles upon explosion
		SpellPage_Time:
			'''
			Fire a projectile at cursor's position
			On hit, freeze an area of hostile projectiles for 6 seconds
			This spell has a 12 second cooldown
			'''
		SpellPage_Life: Fire five times at cursor's position with projectiles that steal life
		SpellPage_Matter:
			'''
			Gains a buff that lasts for 32 seconds
			This buff grants your magic projectile the following effects:
			On hit, buff your defense by 1, up to 60
			'''
		SpellPage_Nothingness:
			'''
			Finishing the chant erases your existance for 4 seconds
			Projectiles spawn from thin air and fire to enemies
			Left click to return
			This spell has a 65 second cooldown
			'''
		SpellPage_Death:
			'''
			When recieving a fatal hit, enters predying state
			This spell has a 20 second cooldown
			'''
		SpellPage_Finale:
			'''
			Summon a timer that lasts for 100 seconds
			When the timer reaches zero, erase all enemies on the screen
			'''
		DivineFireDeathReason: was melt in Gods' grace;
		PlagueDeathReason: became a lump that stopped struggling.
		PerpetualDeathReason: was bankrupted.
		SlimeOceanDeathReason: sank into the sea of slimes.
		BlowingOneselfUpDeathReason: blew themself up.
		BlowingOtherUpDeathReason: was blown up.
		UnexistedDeathReason: never seemed to exist.
		HolyWallDeathReason: left the grape branch.
		DeathSpellFailure: Ashes to ashes, dust to dust...
		DeathSpellSuccess: But they refused!
		FFF: "'s body was eventually found. Their eyeballs were dug out, and blood gushed from the wound. Their expression was extremely frightened."
