		WingSlot_1: Wings
		WingSlot_2: Wings Dye
		BossChecklist1: Fish at the beach with [i:ContinentOfJourney/Squidfood] equipped.
		BossChecklist2: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/CannedSoulofFlight] in space.
		BossChecklist3: Destroy a Portal to Another World in the Abyss or use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/UnstableGlobe].
		BossChecklist4: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/MetalSpine] in the Dungeon.
		BossChecklist5: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/UltimateTorch] at the seal under the Abyss. Use a [i:1326] or a [i:ContinentOfJourney/EurekaEffect] to reach the seal.
		BossChecklist6: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/SunlightCrown] in space.
		BossChecklist7: Right click the Hallowed Altar When the sands float without touching anything.
		BossChecklist8: Right click the Hallowed Altar when your maximum life has reached over 600.
		BossChecklist9: Right click the Hallowed Altar when water tile and lava tile come into contact without turning into obsidians.
		BossChecklist10: Use [i:ContinentOfJourney/KarmaPlugItem] while aiming at the critical point located in Space/ Forest/ Cave/ Underworld/ Desert/ Jungle/ Snow biome/ Evil/ Hallow.
		BossChecklist11: Right click the Hallowed Altar when it is placed on unseen tiles.
		BossChecklist12: Right click the Hallowed Altar when you turn the dead creatures alive at the beach.
		BossChecklist13: Purchase the blueprint from Goblin Tinkerer with [i:ContinentOfJourney/AncientBuilderBookletChapter3] in your inventory. Right click the Hallowed Altar after you finished building.
		GC: Goblin Chariot
		BD: Big Dipper
		PO: Puppet Opera
		BossChecklist14: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/PurpleFlareGun], which is randomly dropped during a goblin invasion.
		BossChecklist15: Use a [i:ContinentOfJourney/MaliciousPacket] in space.
		BossChecklist16: At the center of the Maze, input the password illustrated in [i:ContinentOfJourney/ThePassword], which is often found in the Dungeon or in a Dungeon Crate.
		Blasphemy_1: Warning: Blasphemy against the Time God has been detected.
		Blasphemy_2: Warning: Blasphemy against the Life God has been detected.
		Blasphemy_3: Warning: Blasphemy against the Matter God has been detected.
		Blasphemy_4: Warning: Blasphemy against Myths has been detected.
		Blasphemy_5: Warning: Blasphemy against Death has been detected.
		Blasphemy_6: Warning! Warning! Warning!
		Blasphemy_5_1: The ceremony should be held near the Ocean.
		Blasphemy_6_1: The ceremony should be held near the Hallow.
		JokeSeed_Waifu_1_1: Congratulations, You've found this seed!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_1_2: Now you'll have the honor of being accompanied by us three supreme beings throughout your adventure! Be grateful, teheehee!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_1_3: Technically, we only stay before they break down the barrier. So...
		JokeSeed_Waifu_1_4: Bah! It's just the beginning, and here's your blahblahblah already!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_1_5: Fine, Whatever.
		JokeSeed_Waifu_2_1: You forgot to carry some items from the Builder's Worlkshop?
		JokeSeed_Waifu_2_2: I believe it's either 9999 platinum coins or a bunch of life crystals, or both.
		JokeSeed_Waifu_2_3: Can't rule out the possibility of taking some vanities.
		JokeSeed_Waifu_2_4: Hey, that's cheating anyway!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_3_1: Chop-chop, which class are you going to play?
		JokeSeed_Waifu_3_2: I actually doubt if they'll choose one. Also it's just starting up, you use whatever you pick up.
		JokeSeed_Waifu_3_3: Oh look, a slime!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_3_4: A Master Mode one. Let's put up a good fight!
		JokeSeed_Waifu_3_5: Eh, that's an Expert Mode one. Not tough enough!
