		WeatherBuff-1: For blizzard, enter snow biome during rain
		WeatherBuff1:
			'''
			Player movement speed increased by 12%
			Enemy spawn rate decreased 20%
			Maximum enemy spawn decreased by 10%
			'''
		WeatherBuff1PlyFree: Player movement speed increased by 12%
		WeatherBuff2:
			'''
			Reduce cold damage
			Player immune to Frozen and Chilled
			Enemies receive 20% extra damage from debuffs
			The following effects are removed
			within 30 seconds of entering water / when wet:
			-Player regen decreased by 1
			-Player receives 10% extra damage from debuffs
			'''
		WeatherBuff2PlyFree:
			'''
			Reduce cold damage
			Immune to Frozen and Chilled
			Enemies receive 20% extra damage from debuffs
			'''
		WeatherBuff3:
			'''
			Enemies fall from sky
			Random items fall from sky
			Player movement speed increased
			when facing the direction of the wind
			'''
		WeatherBuff4:
			'''
			Fishing power increased by 10%
			Reforge price decreased by 10%
			Pumpkins and herbs drop rate increased
			Tile update rate increased
			'''
		WeatherBuff5:
			'''
			Big snowflakes randomly fall and freeze entities
			Enemy movement speed decreased by 5%
			The following effects are removed
			within 30 seconds of approaching torches or campfires / when warm:
			-Player regen decreased by 2
			'''
		WeatherBuff5PlyFree:
			'''
			Big snowflakes randomly fall and freeze entities
			Enemy movement speed decreased by 5%
			Player regen increased by 2
			'''
		WeatherBuff7:
			'''
			Player fall speed increased by 10%
			Airborne enemies movement speed decreased by 7%
			'''
		WeatherBuff8:
			'''
			Player jump speed increased by 50%
			Player flight speed increased by 10%
			Friendly projectile speed increased by 5%
			Airborne enemies movement speed increased by 7%
			'''
		WeatherBuff9: All entities' maximum hp decreased by 10%
		WeatherBuff10:
			'''
			Raining knives hit enemies constantly
			and hit you once every second
			'''
		WeatherBuff11:
			'''
			Donuts fly across screen that heal you by 50 hp
			and heal enemies by 0.5% hp upon contact
			Touching a donut temporarily decreases
			your movement speed by 10%
			'''
		WeatherBuff12:
			'''
			Enables free movement midair with directional keys
			All enemies and hostile projectiles now float and
			home in on the target player
			'''
		WeatherBuff13: Hitbox of every entity is copied at left and right
		WeatherBuff14:
			'''
			Coins rain from sky, damaging player and turning
			into pickable items upon landing
			'''
		WeatherBuff15:
			'''
			Greatly decreases your field of view
			Negates Dangersense and Hunter potions' effect
			No enemy can sense you
			Strong enemies out of your field of view will depart from the battle
			'''
		WeatherBuff16:
			'''
			Player hp decreased by {0} per second
			Cooldown of healing potion is fixed at 6 seconds
			Enemy hp decreased by 0.05% per second
			'''
